<Layout page="about" title="About: the team behind the work" description="Truvantik is the AI consulting brand of Prabhaavi Solutions. Engineering-led work from assessment through deployment.">
  <PageIntro title="Built around the work after the demo." description="We’re an engineering-led AI consulting team. Our focus is the practical distance between a promising idea and a system people use." />
  <section class="container section section--ruled split"><h2>The model is rarely the whole problem.</h2><div class="prose"><p>A pilot can work in a notebook and still go unused. The data sits elsewhere. The output doesn’t reach the right person. Nobody owns what happens when it fails.</p><p>Truvantik connects assessment, product engineering and deployment so those questions stay part of the same conversation.</p><a class="text-link" href={path('why-truvantik')}>How we work <Arrow /></a></div></section>
  <section class="container section section--ruled split"><div><h2>A clear structure.<br />A shared way of working.</h2><p class="lead">Truvantik is the AI consulting brand of Prabhaavi Solutions. Tapioca Health is a separate product brand built with 3BP Labs.</p></div><div class="brand-structure"><div><strong>Prabhaavi Solutions</strong><span>Parent company</span></div><div class="brand-structure__main"><Mark size={40} /><span>AI consulting</span></div><div><a class="text-link" href="https://tapiocahealth.com">Tapioca Health <Arrow /></a><span>Separate product brand · Built with 3BP Labs</span></div></div></section>
  <Close title="Let’s understand what you’re trying to make better." />
</Layout>
